# Worktrees under .claude/ are full repo copies — a bare `prettier --check .`
# descends into every one of them and takes minutes. vitest.config.ts excludes
# `**/.claude/**` for the same reason and says so there.
.claude
# Cebab's own runtime output. When the repo IS the workspace root, running the
# app writes .cebab/ next to the source — and it holds operator-authored
# markdown that was never ours to format. It is excluded via
# .git/info/exclude, so it is untracked and CI's fresh clone never sees it:
# `format:check` was green on CI and red for anyone who had actually run
# Cebab, which is the split that teaches people to ignore the gate.
.cebab
# Generated by `UPDATE_SCHEMA_SNAPSHOT=1 vitest run …/schema_snapshot.test.ts`.
# The generator owns the format (`JSON.stringify(…, null, 2)`); prettier
# collapses short arrays, so letting it reformat would make the file differ
# from what regeneration produces and diff on every migration — a churn the
# reviewer then learns to skip past, which is the opposite of the point.
server/src/migrations/schema_snapshot.json
